    "specPath": "specs/167-read-only-tool-projection/spec.md",
    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "Adds a transport-neutral, read-only tool projection derived from the spec-162 capability catalog: one tool descriptor per eligible judging-tier read, with a closed input schema, the exact argv it maps to, budget and pagination members, trust marking, and a closed error vocabulary. A tool call is one invocation of the pinned binary's existing verb, so its answer is that verb's bytes. spec-spine ships the descriptors and their tests; it runs no server, holds no session, and adds no write tool.\n",
    "title": "Project cataloged reads as read-only tools"
  },
